  "body": "If I understand the [`Vary:`-header specification](http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7231#section-7.1.4) and [a blog post about \"Caching with CORS\"](https://www.fastly.com/blog/caching-cors) correctly, the header refers to request headers like `Accept-Encoding`, and not response headers. So the example should `Vary` on the `Origin` request header, not the `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` response header.\n",
